uer (valid tokens accepted, invalid/expired tokens rejected).\n- Structured authentication-decision and rate-limit-enforcement log entries are produced and retrievable from CKS Grafana Loki.\n- A MaaSSubscription with token rate limits configured returns HTTP 429 when the quota is exceeded (TokenRateLimitPolicy enforcement functional on CKS).\n- License validation of the standalone components and their transitive dependencies completes with no blocking findings (or findings are documented with remediation).\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- HLR-7 (P0): RHCL official xKS support status confirmed and deployment mechanism validated (this branch realizes the fallback mechanism).\n- HLR-3 (P0): Token rate limiting functional on xKS (Limitador enforcement path).\n- HLR-10 (P1): Observability logging functional (Authorino/Limitador structured logging half).\n\n## Notes\n\n- This is a conditional branch epic (branch B), gated by the RHCL/Kuadrant xKS support investigation; it is attached to that investigation as a plan document and is not a standalone Jira issue.\n- Gate failure impact: if outcome B does not hold (standalone deployment also not viable), this epic is removed and the direct Envoy ext_authz contingency (branch C) applies instead.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":90608,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b3d12adea12401d9","agent_id":"a585326c42577ebb9","session_id":"03f22d79-03f4-4cd2-8583-e4fd3448986e","uuid":"323102ce-457c-420a-9a0e-b6727312838e","timestamp":"2026-10-22T05:00:18.397Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-8003"}
