n a deployed MaaS instance on CKS with Perses dashboards installed, when an admin navigates to the MaaS observability dashboard, then the dashboard displays token usage per subscription, rate limiting enforcement events, and API key lifecycle metrics over the last 24 hours, measured by dashboard rendering with live data.\n49\t- The CKS Prometheus instance successfully scrapes the MaaS metrics endpoints (scrape targets healthy), or an access issue is documented and escalated to the xKS Platform / CoreWeave owners.\n50\t- Dashboards render correctly against the CKS Prometheus data source.\n51\t\n52\t## HLR Traceability\n53\t\n54\t- HLR-8 (P0): Observability metrics functional — dashboard and CKS Prometheus integration half (the metric instrumentation itself is covered by the maas-api instrumentation epic).\n55\t\n56\t## Notes\n57\t\n58\t- Depends on CKS infrastructure assumed available per the strategy (CoreWeave standard infrastructure); accessibility is validated as part of this epic's acceptance criteria and the CKS infrastructure validation pass.\n59\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a608d0b6c1ea84d3","agent_id":"a8dbaf530c1362791","session_id":"03f22d79-03f4-4cd2-8583-e4fd3448986e","uuid":"9b09480a-c8c6-4220-bb5c-c0a240a2c386","timestamp":"2026-10-22T05:04:32.863Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-bcf7f31a70ce0edb","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-8003 decomposition"}
